  100 FORMAT (1H0//47H  INPUT ERROR.  GEOMETRY INCORRECTLY SPECIFIED.)          
  200 FORMAT (1H0//62H  INPUT ERROR.  REAR-BOUNDARY CONDITION INCORRECTL        
     1Y SPECIFIED.)                                                             
  300 FORMAT (1H0//48H  INPUT ERROR.  INTERNAL RADIUS INCORRECTLY SET.)         
  400 FORMAT (1H0//52H  INPUT ERROR.  CONCENTRATION AND TIME DEPENDENCE         
     1OF/15X,37H DIFFUSION COEFFICIENT NOT SPECIFIED.)                          
  500 FORMAT (1H0//69H  INPUT ERROR.  MAXIMUM VALUE OF DIFFUSION COEFFIC        
     1IENT NOT SPECIFIED.)                                                      
  600 FORMAT (1H0//63H  INPUT ERROR.  FRONT-BOUNDARY CONDITION INCORRECT        
     1LY SPECIFIED.)                                                            
  700 FORMAT (1H0//66H  INPUT ERROR.  FRONT-BOUNDARY VOLUME RATIO INCORR        
     1ECTLY SPECIFIED.)                                                         
  800 FORMAT (1H0//65H  INPUT ERROR.  REAR-BOUNDARY VOLUME RATIO INCORRE        
