  900 FORMAT (1H0//45H  INPUT ERROR.  GRID SPACING INCORRECTLY SET.)            
 1000 FORMAT (1H0//48H  INPUT ERROR.  INITIAL CONDITION NOT SPECIFIED.)         
 1100 FORMAT (1H0//63H  INPUT ERROR.  CLOSED SYSTEM WITH UNIFORM INITIAL        
     1 DISTRIBUTION/15X,36H AND EQUILIBRIUM AT BOTH BOUNDARIES.)                
 1200 FORMAT (1H0//58H  INPUT ERROR.  NEGATIVE BOUNDARY CONCENTRATION SP        
     1ECIFIED.)                                                                 
